Package: panache
Title: Format Quarto and Other Markdown Flavors
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
      "Johan",
      "Larsson",
      email = "johan@jolars.co",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4029-5945")
    )
Description: Format documents with 'Panache'. Functions are provided for styling
    character strings and files, together with plugins for formatting documents
    open in the 'RStudio' integrated development environment. R code chunks use
    'arity' by default, and external code formatting can be configured through R
    lists or 'Panache' configuration files.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://jolars.github.io/panache-r/, https://github.com/jolars/panache-r,
    https://panache.bz
BugReports: https://github.com/jolars/panache-r/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    arity (>= 0.1.0)
Suggests:
    rstudioapi,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    withr
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
